{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a completely new pricing experience called:
    
    "Transformation Plan Selector"
    
    Do not create traditional pricing cards.
    
    Do not create separate product blocks.
    
    Do not create a pricing table.
    
    Build a premium selectable plan configurator inspired by:
    
    • Mercedes-Benz configurator
    • BMW iDrive package selection
    • Apple product storage selection
    • Sky Sins Training checkout flow
    
    The entire section must feel premium, compact, modern and conversion-focused.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE
    
    Top Label:
    YOUR TRANSFORMATION STARTS HERE
    
    Headline:
    Choose The Journey That Matches Your Ambition
    
    Subheadline:
    Every transformation begins with commitment. Select the level of support, accountability and guidance that aligns with your goals.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PLAN SELECTION SYSTEM
    
    Create compact selectable plans using radio-button style selection.
    
    Only ONE plan can be selected at a time.
    
    Selecting a plan should:
    
    • Highlight the card
    • Increase opacity
    • Add orange glow
    • Fill radio button
    • Slightly increase scale
    • Update CTA button price dynamically
    
    Unselected plans should:
    
    • Lower opacity
    • Reduced glow
    • Smaller scale
    • Empty radio button
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PLAN 1
    
    Label:
    THE FOUNDATION
    
    Duration:
    1 MONTH
    
    Price:
    Rs 500
    
    Monthly equivalent:
    Rs 500/month
    
    Description:
    For those ready to take the first step.
    
    Features:
    ✓ Personalized Nutrition Plan
    ✓ Customized Workout Program
    ✓ Goal Assessment
    
    Footer:
    Start building momentum.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PLAN 2
    
    Label:
    THE MOMENTUM PHASE
    
    Duration:
    3 MONTHS
    
    Price:
    Rs 900
    
    Original Price:
    Rs 1500
    
    Savings:
    SAVE Rs 600
    
    Monthly equivalent:
    ≈ Rs 300/month
    
    Description:
    For those committed to building sustainable habits.
    
    Features:
    ✓ Everything In Foundation
    ✓ Progress Monitoring
    ✓ Monthly Adjustments
    
    Footer:
    Create consistency and sustainable progress.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PLAN 3
    
    Label:
    THE TRANSFORMATION PHASE
    
    Badge:
    ⭐ MOST POPULAR
    
    Duration:
    6 MONTHS
    
    Price:
    Rs 1500
    
    Original Price:
    Rs 3000
    
    Savings:
    SAVE Rs 1500
    
    Monthly equivalent:
    ≈ Rs 250/month
    
    Description:
    The ideal balance between accountability, support and measurable results.
    
    Features:
    ✓ Everything In Momentum Phase
    ✓ Priority Support
    ✓ Advanced Adjustments
    ✓ Long-Term Strategy
    
    Footer:
    Recommended for clients seeking meaningful and sustainable transformation.
    
    Default selected plan:
    YES
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PLAN 4
    
    Label:
    THE ELITE PHASE
    
    Badge:
    ✅ BEST VALUE
    
    Duration:
    12 MONTHS
    
    Price:
    Rs 2400
    
    Original Price:
    Rs 6000
    
    Savings:
    SAVE Rs 3600
    
    Monthly equivalent:
    ≈ Rs 200/month
    
    Description:
    Our most complete transformation experience.
    
    Features:
    ✓ Everything In Transformation Phase
    ✓ Extended Support
    ✓ Premium Guidance
    ✓ Lifestyle Optimization
    
    Footer:
    Designed for complete lifestyle transformation.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    LAYOUT RULES
    
    Cards should be compact.
    
    Target height:
    120px to 170px only.
    
    Do not create tall cards.
    
    Keep all important information visible immediately.
    
    Use horizontal information hierarchy:
    
    LEFT SIDE:
    • Plan name
    • Duration
    • Description
    
    RIGHT SIDE:
    • Original price
    • Current price
    • Monthly equivalent
    • Savings badge
    
    Radio button on far right.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    DESIGN LANGUAGE
    
    Background:
    #050505
    
    Primary Text:
    #FFFFFF
    
    Secondary Text:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.72)
    
    Accent:
    #FF6200
    
    Glow:
    rgba(255,98,0,0.35)
    
    Card Background:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.02)
    
    Selected Card Background:
    rgba(255,98,0,0.06)
    
    Selected Border:
    1px solid rgba(255,98,0,0.4)
    
    Border Radius:
    24px
    
    No harsh shadows.
    
    No visible gradients.
    
    Everything should feel like luxury automotive UI.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    URGENCY MODULE
    
    Below plan selector create:
    
    PRICE INCREASES IN
    
    Live countdown timer:
    
    07:36:12
    
    Subtext:
    
    Lock today's pricing before the next increase.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PRIMARY CTA
    
    There should be ONLY ONE CTA button.
    
    The button updates dynamically based on selected plan.
    
    Examples:
    
    START YOUR TRANSFORMATION — Rs 500
    
    START YOUR TRANSFORMATION — Rs 900
    
    START YOUR TRANSFORMATION — Rs 1500
    
    START YOUR TRANSFORMATION — Rs 2400
    
    CTA should remain sticky on mobile.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    TRUST ELEMENTS
    
    Below CTA show:
    
    27,000+ transformations completed
    
    ✓ Secure Checkout
    ✓ WhatsApp Support Included
    ✓ Delivered Within 48 Hours
    ✓ Works For Gym And Home Training
    
    Final line:
    
    After checkout:
    Questionnaire → Progress Photos → Plan Delivery Within 48 Hours
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS
    
    • Mobile-first
    • No layout shifts
    • GPU accelerated transforms only
    • 60fps on iPhone Safari
    • Optimized for older Android devices
    • No heavy animations
    • No excessive blur effects
    • Smooth scrolling
    • Fast loading
    
    The final result should feel closer to configuring a Mercedes S-Class package than browsing a traditional fitness pricing page.
{% enddoc %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-transformation-plan-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 20px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-transformation-plan-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px 40px;
    }
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-transformation-plan-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-transformation-plan-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    opacity: 0.6;
    transform: scale(0.98);
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected {
    background: {{ block.settings.selected_card_background }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.selected_border_color }};
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px {{ block.settings.glow_color }};
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

.ai-transformation-plan-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #111111;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-duration-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }};
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-original-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-monthly-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-savings-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-radio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected .ai-transformation-plan-radio-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-radio-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0);
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected .ai-transformation-plan-radio-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-urgency-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-urgency-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-countdown-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-urgency-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: sticky;
    bottom: 0;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: 20px 0;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 18px 32px;
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: Helvetica;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-trust-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-trust-stat-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-trust-items-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-transformation-plan-trust-items-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-transformation-plan-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

